00:46:24.210 --> 00:46:26.140
Bom, relator, deputado,

00:46:26.930 --> 00:46:27.880
seu presidente,

00:46:28.480 --> 00:46:29.040
devolvo

00:46:29.040 --> 00:46:32.120
a matéria

00:46:32.120 --> 00:46:34.040
à minha diretora pela manutenção

00:46:34.040 --> 00:46:35.690
